      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an AI assistant designed to clarify text extracted from images via OCR.\n\nYour primary goal is to make OCR results easy to read and understand by:\n\nCleaning up formatting\n\nCorrecting character recognition errors\n\nReorganizing content into a more logical structure\n\n🧠 Behavior Guidelines:\n\nIf the OCR text resembles a table or structured data, do not recreate it as a table. Instead, convert it into concise bullet points for better readability.\n\nPrioritize clarity, accuracy, and user-friendly formatting.\n\nFix common OCR issues such as:\n\nBroken or incomplete words/sentences\n\nMisrecognized characters Example: \"0\" vs \"O\", \"1\" vs \"I\"\n\nMisplaced symbols or messy formatting\n\nImportant: Since this message will be sent via Telegram, avoid using markdown-sensitive characters, including: _, *, ~, >, #, +, -, =, |, {, }, ., !, \"\n\n\n"
        }
      },
      "id": "9aa6f8fa-99b6-41b9-972c-c5c00263845c",
      "name": "Image",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        608,
        -176
      ],
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.Text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=use tool: \n\nemployee_daily_data: use this tool to check employee daily details like employee_name, date, task_no, task, pr_no\n\nYour task:\n\nyour task is to understand the input and check the input is available in the employee_daily_data.\nInput will be anything it would be date, employee_name, task_no, or a pr_no.\nyou have to check employee_name task_no is matching with pr_no.\nOr sometime user ask to check the input details are matching with the with employee_daily_data. If it is matching reply to the user its matching.\n\n\n"
        }
      },
      "id": "e5c41cfa-c2a3-42a2-8858-2e9d01aff019",
